&lt;p&gt;Points: 4&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;# Comments: 1&lt;/p&gt;</description><guid isPermaLink="false">https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=49520577</guid><pubDate>Tue, 01 Sep 2026 11:36:26 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title>Show HN: What differentiates developers when we all use AI?</title><link>https://aicalculatorpro.com/</link><description>&lt;p&gt;I am a developer with more than 10 years in the IT industry. I like to code because I get the feeling that it makes me sharper. Unfortunately, I am no longer getting this feeling because of the rise of LLMs.&lt;p&gt;We are all, more or less, using the same LLMs. So I am no longer sure what the difference is between me and other developers.&lt;p&gt;Before, I was proud of the quality of work that I did and the speed at which I was able to deliver it. Now I am just a reviewer of the code that was generated by the LLMs and trying to use my experience to guide it better.&lt;p&gt;I don't have an unlimited budget for LLMs, and I'm guessing most developers don't either. I was thinking that the differentiation factor would be who can do the same job cheaper. My interest was to find the best-value LLMs for the job, in terms of pricing and intelligence.&lt;p&gt;Because of this I built &lt;a href="https://aicalculatorpro.com/" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://aicalculatorpro.com/&lt;/a&gt;. A website that doesn't need a sign-up and is free, so that other developers can have the same insight.&lt;p&gt;The site is vibe coded, as you can see. I launched it in July.&lt;p&gt;The page I personally use most is the LLM price changes page: &lt;a href="https://aicalculatorpro.com/llm-price-changes/" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://aicalculatorpro.com/llm-price-changes/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;Over time, it will grow and become an audit log. Here I can see which new models are launched. I was also thinking that you can save money by switching providers, so for each model I list the providers. For example, this one: &lt;a href="https://aicalculatorpro.com/models/zhipu/glm-5.3-flash/" rel="nofollow"&gt;https://aicalculatorpro.com/models/zhipu/glm-5.3-flash/&lt;/a&gt;&lt;p&gt;What do you think will be the differentiating factors now that we are all using LLMs?&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;hr /&gt;
